hy pre-restart behavior and boot identity were captured, restart was acknowledged, the node temporarily became unreachable, a different boot identity appeared, and system, exporter, source-data, and export behavior recovered. Fixed lifecycle observations independently corroborate the boot transition.","limitations":["Redaction behavior was directly tested across several representative formats, but captured evidence cannot exhaustively prove every syntactically possible email address or auth_token encoding.","The final lifecycle inventory directly covers /tmp but not /var/tmp, so cleanup of the boot-identity marker and reboot log cannot be confirmed.","There is no clustered service in this single-node task; restart recovery evidence appropriately covers system state, exporter persistence, source data, and output behavior rather than cluster resynchronization."]}
